---
const providers = [
  { name: 'Ollama', note: 'local, free, private', tag: 'local' },
  { name: 'PeerLLM', note: 'a peer serves models to you', tag: 'mesh' },
  { name: 'Claude Code CLI', note: 'the login you already have', tag: 'cli' },
  { name: 'Codex CLI', note: 'the login you already have', tag: 'cli' },
  { name: 'Antigravity CLI', note: 'the login you already have', tag: 'cli' },
  { name: 'Anthropic', note: 'API key' },
  { name: 'OpenAI', note: 'API key' },
  { name: 'Google Gemini', note: 'API key' },
  { name: 'OpenRouter', note: 'API key, hundreds of models' },
  { name: 'DeepSeek', note: 'API key' },
  { name: 'xAI Grok', note: 'API key' },
  { name: 'Moonshot Kimi', note: 'API key' },
  { name: 'MiniMax', note: 'API key' },
  { name: 'Meta', note: 'API key' },
];
---

<section id="providers" class="providers-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Runs on Your Terms</h2>
    <p class="providers-intro">
      Abject needs a mind to borrow and is flexible about whose. Bring an API key, run a
      free local model, reuse a coding subscription you already pay for, or let a friend's
      machine serve you models over the mesh. Route cheap jobs to cheap models and the hard
      ones to the smart one; the four tiers (smart, balanced, fast, code) are yours to point
      anywhere.
    </p>
    <ul class="providers-grid">
      {providers.map((p) => (
        <li class={`provider ${p.tag ? `provider-${p.tag}` : ''}`}>
          <span class="provider-name">{p.name}</span>
          <span class="provider-note">{p.note}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <p class="providers-foot">
      Fourteen providers, one settings tab. Switch any time; the abjects never notice.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .providers-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: -1.5rem auto 2.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .providers-grid {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .provider {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .provider:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--eldritch-glow);
  }

  .provider-local {
    border-color: rgba(91, 229, 160, 0.45);
  }

  .provider-mesh {
    border-color: rgba(139, 123, 255, 0.45);
  }

  .provider-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .provider-local .provider-name {
    color: var(--eldritch);
  }

  .provider-mesh .provider-name {
    color: var(--void-purple);
  }

  .provider-note {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .providers-foot {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
